   "source": [
    "cell1 = schemdraw.Drawing(inches_per_unit=0.75)\n",
    "cell1.add(elm.Line().right().length(2))\n",
    "cell1.add(elm.Line().up())\n",
    "cell1.add(elm.Line().left())\n",
    "cell1.add(elm.Line().left())\n",
    "cell1.add(elm.Line().down())\n",
    "cell1.add(elm.Line().right().length(2))\n",
    "cell1.add(elm.Gap().label('').down())\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# annotate diagram\n",
    "fig = cell1.draw()\n",
    "fig.plot([0, 0],[0.5, -0.5])\n",
    "fig.ax.annotate('Ag', (0.15,-0.5))\n",
    "fig.plot([-0.05, -0.05],[0.5, -0.5], 'red')\n",
    "fig.ax.annotate('AgCl', (-0.3,-0.95), color='red')\n",
    "fig.plot([-2, -2],[0.5, -0.5]) # cathode\n",
    "fig.ax.annotate('Pt', (-2.5,-0.5))\n",
    "fig.plot([-3, 1., 1., -3, -3],[-1.5, -1.5, 1.5, 1.5, -1.5], fill=(0,0,1,0.05)) # reaction cell\n",
    "fig.ax.annotate(r'$H_2O$, $H_2$, HCl', (-1.6,0), fontsize=10)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig.fig.savefig('../workspace/cell1.png')\n",
    "display(fig)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Considering the composition of the reaction cell, the possible reactions are:\n",
    "\n",
    "$2H^+ + 2e^- \\rightleftharpoons H_2$ ($E^0$ = 0 V)\n",
    "\n",
    "$ 1/2 O_2 + 2H^+ + 2e^- \\rightleftharpoons H_2O$ ($E^0$ = 1.23 V)\n",
    "\n",
    "$AgCl + e^- \\rightleftharpoons Ag_s + Cl^-_{aq}$ ($E^0$ = 0.22 V)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Option 1: Pt anode and Ag cathode\n",
    "\n",
    "$H_2 \\rightleftharpoons 2H^+ + 2e^-_{Pt}$\n",
    "\n",
    "$2AgCl + 2e^-_{Ag} \\rightleftharpoons 2Ag + 2Cl^-$\n",
    "\n",
    "The overall reaction is therefore:\n",
    "\n",
    "$H_2 + 2AgCl \\rightleftharpoons 2H^+ + 2Ag + 2Cl^-$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Option 2: Pt cathode and Ag anode\n",
    "\n",
    "$2H^+ + 2e^-_{Pt} \\rightleftharpoons H_2$\n",
    "\n",
    "$2Ag + 2Cl^- \\rightleftharpoons 2AgCl + 2e^-_{Ag}$\n",
    "\n",
    "The overall reaction is therefore:\n",
    "\n",
    "$ 2H^+ + 2Ag + 2Cl^- \\rightleftharpoons H_2 + 2AgCl$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div class=\"alert alert-block alert-success\">\n",
    "<b>Net outcome</b>: The identity of the reaction does not change, simply the direction in which the reaction proceeds. The electrochemical cell is <b>chemically reversible</b>.\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Example 2\n",
    "\n",
    "Consider the reaction cell below"
   ]
  },
